{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"流行語大賞...\nやっぱり面白い(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やはりPPAPはトップテン！\nアモーレも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の流行語大賞の言葉は例年よりも\n分かるのが多い気がします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも斎藤さんだぞが\nトップテン外なのは意外...(_ _).｡o○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/12/02/0450980/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むむ！っていう顔してみた、\n斎藤さんだぞ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"----------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#chihashot"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/12/02/0450980/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またしても大好きな空。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴルフ場で撮ったので、\n見える景色が広い。\n空が広いと気持ち良いです\\( ˆ ˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポイントは、空以外は影に見えるので\n空の綺麗さが際立つところ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"木々がいい味だしてるなぁ\nよきよき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青とオレンジの空が一番好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"----------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「足音〜Be Strong」Mr.Childrenさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に素敵な曲。\n素敵な歌詞でいつ聞いても感動する。\n夢を持っている方、\n夢に向かって歩んでいる方、\nまたそれを応援している方には\nより一層この曲は染みると思います。\n\"夢見てた未来は それほど離れちゃいない\nまた一歩 次の一歩 足音を踏み鳴らせ！\"\n頑張らなきゃな、と思える。\n涙も出てきそうになってくる。\n受験に向けて頑張っている受験生の皆さんにも\n是非聞いていただきたい曲です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い立ってやっと買えた！\nきのこの山！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安定の美味しさでした。\nやはりチョコとビスケットは別々に食べるのが好きかも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたにもおすそ分け...♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/12/02/0450980/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/12/02/0450980/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しい？(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)ふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}